      reason: "L = L₀ / γ = 15 km / 7.09 = 2.1 km. The muon covers 0.65 km per mean lifetime in this frame, so the survival fraction is about e^(−2.1/0.65) ≈ 4%, the same as the Earth-frame result e^(−15/4.6) ≈ 4%."
